        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Plants: Dieffenbachia, Carlina, Dieffenbachia bowmanii\n- People: David Bowman, Thomas Lobb, William Lobb\n- Companies: Veitch Nurseries\n- Topics: plant taxonomy, Victorian plant hunting\n\nFacts:\n- Dieffenbachia is a genus of tropical flowering plants in the family Araceae.\n- Carlina is a genus of flowering plants in the family Asteraceae.\n- In the Victorian period, Veitch Nurseries employed plant hunters including Thomas Lobb, William Lobb, and David Bowman.\n- Dieffenbachia bowmanii is a species named after David Bowman.",
